controlplane ~ ➜  kubectl get pod crashy -o yaml | grep restartPolicy
  restartPolicy: Always

controlplane ~ ➜  
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

| restartPolicy | Behavior                      |
| ------------- | ----------------------------- |
| Always        | Restart forever (Deployments) |
| OnFailure     | Restart only on non-zero exit |
| Never         | Run once and stop             |

👉 Pods default to Always.
